<title>SPAIN: Cerus to sell 48.05 pct of Cofir.</title>
<headline>Cerus to sell 48.05 pct of Cofir.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French firm Cerus is to sell its 48.05 percent stake in Spain's Cofir via a private international placement with institutions, the Stock Exchange Comission CMNV said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
